# BlankStare needs no environment variables.
#
# It is a browser extension with no server. The keys it uses (Groq, and
# optionally YouTube) are typed into its Settings page and kept in the user's
# own Chrome profile (chrome.storage.sync). They never touch this repository.
#
# This file exists because every repo carries one (repo standards §1), and so
# nobody goes looking for a missing .env.
